<!--ID=FCB40C2B-1F9F-4C26-B1A1-CF8E67BE07D1;Version=1|{"Files":{}}-->
<!--ID=5B95B1CC-2C7B-494F-B746-CF22A0E779B7;Version=1|{"Locales":{"en-US":{"AutoApplyCustomLexiconFiles":[{}]},"en-GB":{"AutoApplyCustomLexiconFiles":[{}]}}}-->
<speak xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis"
       xmlns:mstts="http://www.w3.org/2001/mstts"
       xmlns:emo="http://www.w3.org/2009/10/emotionml"
       version="1.0"
       xml:lang="en-GB">
  <voice name="en-GB-OllieMultilingualNeural">
    <prosody rate="-11.00%" pitch="-2.50%">
      When Joseph came near, his brothers recognized him from a distance.<break time="500ms"/>
      Their envy had ripened into action.<break time="500ms"/>
      They took the robe from him.<break time="500ms"/>
      And they threw him into a pit that held no water.<break time="1800ms"/>

      The road he thought he was walking was gone.<break time="500ms"/>
      The safety he knew was gone.<break time="500ms"/>
      What remained was confusion, dust, and waiting at the bottom of a place he had not chosen.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Then traders passed by on the road to Egypt.<break time="500ms"/>
      Instead of leaving Joseph in the pit, his brothers sold him.<break time="500ms"/>
      And the young dreamer was carried away toward a foreign land.<break time="1000ms"/>
      Far from his father.<break time="500ms"/>
      Far from the fields of home.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Even a road chosen by cruelty cannot become a road outside of God.<break time="500ms"/>
      The robe was gone, but Joseph's life was not outside the reach of heaven.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Behind him, the robe was stained and shown to Jacob.<break time="500ms"/>
      Grief spread through the family.<break time="500ms"/>
      Ahead of him, Joseph could not yet see what would come next.<break time="1800ms"/>

      The pit was real.<break time="1000ms"/>
      The road to Egypt was real.<break time="1000ms"/>
      But neither one was beyond God's sight.<break time="1800ms"/>
      You can rest.<break time="3800ms"/>
    </prosody>
  </voice>
</speak>
